---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Practice Health Guides" description="Education-based email lead generation for dental practices. Stop using the sledgehammer method — educate, build trust, and convert.">

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-teal text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">Education-Based Lead Generation</span>
          <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
            Practice<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">Health Guides</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md">
            Stop using a sledgehammer to bring in new patients. Educate, build trust, and convert — without discounts, gimmicks, or racing to the bottom on price.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-slate hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
            Get in Touch &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div>
            <img src="/ppcd-screen.png" alt="Practice Health Guides" style="border: 1px solid #CCC" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">

      <!-- Row 1: Sledgehammer + Educate box -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-700 text-brand-dark">The Sledgehammer Method — And Why It Fails</h2>
          <p>Here's a familiar scenario: you spend $2,000/mo offering a $1,000 discount for Invisalign or dental implants via Google and Facebook Ads, and to nobody's surprise, you generate zero quality new patients.</p>
          <p>This is what we call the <strong class="text-brand-dark">Sledgehammer Method</strong> — asking people who have no familiarity with you to commit to spending a lot of money for a service. You're skipping the dating and going straight to the marriage proposal. In the real world, instant proposals rarely last as long-term relationships.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-slate rounded-2xl p-7 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 mb-3">Educate. Build Authority. Build Trust.</h3>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Practice Health Guides works with a straightforward approach: we customize a lead magnet (eBook) for your practice — such as "Top 5 Facts About Invisalign" or "The 5 Biggest Myths About Dental Implants" — and place an opt-in form on your website.</p>
          <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">Once the user opts in, they receive a series of targeted emails designed to educate them about the topic, establish you as an experienced authority, and build trust — long before they ever walk through your door.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 2: How It Works + Pricing -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark">How It Works</h3>
          <ol class="space-y-4">
            {[
              ['Custom lead magnet eBook', 'Branded to your practice and focused on a specific high-value service like implants, Invisalign, or veneers.'],
              ['Opt-in form on your website', 'A simple, non-intrusive form that captures name and email in exchange for the guide.'],
              ['Automated email nurture sequence', 'A series of educational emails that build trust and establish your authority over time.'],
              ['Warm, qualified leads', 'By the time a prospect books, they already know, like, and trust you.'],
            ].map(([title, desc], i) => (
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <span class="font-display text-2xl font-800 text-brand-red/20 shrink-0 w-8">{i + 1}</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-semibold text-brand-dark text-sm mb-1">{title}</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">{desc}</div>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 text-brand-dark mb-2">Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">There is a one-time initial setup fee to customize the eBook and the emails to your branding, and an affordable low monthly fee for the service.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Contact us to learn more about current pricing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 3: CTA -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-brand-red text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Get Early Access</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-2">Learn More About Practice Health Guides</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Get in touch and we'll reach out to explain how PHG can work for your practice, and to see if it makes sense for you to join the second test cohort.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-600 text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-full transition-colors text-sm">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Questions? Call us at <a href="tel:9734009004" class="text-brand-red font-semibold hover:text-red-700">(973) 400-9004</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
